  "description": "We propose a diffusion-based model, <em>CompoDiff</em>, for Composed Image Retrieval (CIR) task. \n              To train the model, we created a new dataset comprising 18 million triplets of images and associated conditions. \n              <em>CompoDiff</em> shows state-of-the-art zero-shot CIR performance."
